              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Sixteenth Generation: Olivia, Architect Officer"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Served as the Architect Officer of Okhema, overseeing the restoration of the Marmoreal Palace."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Cleared sections of the collapsed underground chambers, connecting various strongholds through tunnels. Passed away peacefully in sleep."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Essence has been extracted, awaiting a suitable successor."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Seventeenth Generation: Livia, Brewmaster"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Stationed at Marmoreal Palace, occasionally working at the Hero's Bathhouse, responsible for gathering intelligence on the Chrysos Heir."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "When receiving the ambrosia, tapping the cup wall three times signals for intelligence to be discreetly attached to the bottom of the plate with the next serving."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "..."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "No. 23"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Forty-First Generation: Gregoni, Scholar of Helkolithism"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Infiltrated the Helkolithism School to steal research findings in pursuit of improving the inheritance ritual."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Fatally injured by a hammer throw during a discus competition, did not survive."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Essence has been extracted, awaiting a suitable successor."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Forty-Second Generation: Koroni, Guard Captain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Stationed at Marmoreal Market, responsible for granting passage privileges and responding to operations when necessary."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Killed in a Nikador faction ambush, fatally wounded while escorting refugees, did not survive."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "(A sharply written annotation) \"Every generation, every single one ends like this... Before acting on impulse, remember why you inherited this title. Is this the kind of death befitting a Cleaner?\""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Essence has been extracted, but is temporarily sealed. Successor selection is postponed."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
